==Snorlax Pin Collection==
Also released on April 3, 2020 in North America was a pair of pin collections featuring food-focused Pokémon {{p|Snorlax}} and {{p|Morpeko}}. The '''Snorlax Pin Collection''' featured the eponymous Pokémon as a {{TCG|SWSH Black Star Promos|SWSH Black Star Promo}} and on an enamel {{TCG|pin}}. Three booster packs and a code card for the [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Online]] were also included. The collection was released outside North America on June 5, 2020.

