The '''Vivid Voltage Build & Battle Box''' was a special product released as an advanced preview for the {{TCG|Vivid Voltage}} expansion. Select retailers could begin selling boxes from October 31, 2020. Each Build & Battle Box included a 23-card [[Evolution]] pack and four Vivid Voltage {{TCG|booster pack}}s. The boxes also included one of four specially stamped {{TCG|Prerelease cards}}: {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Charizard|66}}, {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Donphan|67}}, {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Snorlax|68}}, or {{TCG ID|SWSH Promo|Lugia|69}}. Each card accompanied a group of Pokémon cards that focused on the following types respectively: {{ct|Fire}}, {{ct|Fighting}}, {{ct|Colorless}}, and {{ct|Water}}.

Build & Battle Boxes could include a Non Holofoil version of {{TCG ID|Vivid Voltage|Leon|182}}, which was normally Holofoil in the Vivid Voltage expansion. It was initially exclusive to this product but was later available in the {{TCG|Charizard Theme Deck}}. Boxes could also provide a re-release of Non Holofoil {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Professor's Research|178}} originally from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield Build & Battle Box}}.

