The '''Journey Together Build & Battle Box''' was released as a prelude to the {{TCG|Journey Together}} expansion and offered people the opportunity to experience the cards before their general release on March 28, 2025. Tournaments were typically held on the weekends of March 15-16 and March 22-23, 2025. Boxes could also be purchased from stores in the Prerelease Program from March 15, 2025.

Each box included a ready-to-play 40-card deck plus four Journey Together {{TCG|booster pack}}s to potentially integrate useful cards into it. Decks comprised two of four possible groups of cards, including an alternate-art promotional card, as well as 17 basic {{TCG|Energy card}}s and an assortment of {{TCG|Trainer card}}s. The possible promotional cards included {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|N's Darmanitan|181}}, {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Iono's Kilowattrel|182}}, {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Lillie's Ribombee|183}}, and {{TCG ID|SVP Promo|Hop's Snorlax|184}}. Journey Together Build & Battle Boxes were categorized as Play Level 2.

The boxes could provide exclusive Non Holofoil versions of cards only available as Holofoil in Journey Together booster packs: {{TCG ID|Journey Together|Iono's Kilowattrel|55}} and {{TCG ID|Journey Together|Noivern|128}}.
